    {
      "source": "This class is meant to be subclassed, with subclasses overriding\nonly those methods (such as <a href=\"#create()\"><code>create()</code></a>) that should not simply\ndelegate to the target <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/ConnectionFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>ConnectionFactory</code></a>.",
      "translation": "该类旨在被继承，子类仅重写那些不应简单地委派给目标 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/ConnectionFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>ConnectionFactory</code></a> 的方法（例如 <a href=\"#create()\"><code>create()</code></a>）。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
